      "html": "† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אָפַף</span>]</big></big>  <strong>v. rodear, cercar (</strong>assírio <em>apâpu</em> Zim<sup>BP 59</sup><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito: <span dir=\"rtl\">אָֽפְפוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 40:13\" href=\"/Psalms.40.13\">ψ 40:13</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲפָפוּנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:5\" href=\"/Psalms.18.5\">ψ 18:5</a> +;—<em>cercar</em> (poético); literalmente <a data-ref=\"Jonah 2:6\" href=\"/Jonah.2.6\">Jon 2:6</a> (sujeito: <span dir=\"rtl\">מַיִם</span>); figuradamente, tendo como sujeito males e desventuras <span dir=\"rtl\">רָעוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 40:13\" href=\"/Psalms.40.13\">ψ 40:13</a> (seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">עָלַי</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁבְּרֵי מות</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.5\">2 S 22:5</a>, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">הֶבְלֵי מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:5\" href=\"/Psalms.18.5\">ψ 18:5</a>, também <a data-ref=\"Psalms 116:3\" href=\"/Psalms.116.3\">116:3</a>.",
