      "html": "† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אָפַק</span>]</big></big>  <strong>v. reter, ser forte (</strong>assim Thes, que compara o árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">أَفِقَ</span> <em>sobressair</em> = <em>multum valuit [foi muito forte];</em> MV compara também <span dir=\"rtl\">فاق</span> <strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Hitpael.</strong>  perfeito, terceira pessoa do plural: <span dir=\"rtl\">הִתְאַפָּ֑קוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 63:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.63.15\">Is 63:15</a>; infinitivo: <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהִתְאַפֵּק</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 45:1\" href=\"/Genesis.45.1\">Gn 45:1</a>; imperfeito: <span dir=\"rtl\">וְיִּתְאַפַּק</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 43:31\" href=\"/Genesis.43.31\">Gn 43:31</a>; segunda pessoa masculina singular: <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּתְאַפַּק</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 64:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.64.11\">Is 64:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶתְאַפָּ֑ק</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.14\">Is 42:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וָאֶתְאַפַּק</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.12\">1 S 13:12</a>— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>compelir-se</em> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.12\">1 S 13:12</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  <em>conter-se, abster-se</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 43:31\" href=\"/Genesis.43.31\">Gn 43:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 45:1\" href=\"/Genesis.45.1\">45:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.14\">Is 42:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Esther 5:10\" href=\"/Esther.5.10\">Est 5:10</a>; acerca de <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 64:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.64.11\">Is 64:11</a>; acerca da compaixão de YHWH <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 63:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.63.15\">Is 63:15</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵעֶיךָ וְרַחֲמֶיךָ אֵלַי הִתְאַפָּ֑קוּ</span> (quase passivo).",
