      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֶפְרָתִי</span></big>  <strong>adjetivo gentílico: efratita</strong>.<br><strong>1.</strong>  efraimita; cf. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, אֶפְרָ֫תָה\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_אֶפְרָ֫תָה\">אֶפְרָתָה</a> <strong>1.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Judges 12:5\" href=\"/Judges.12.5\">Ju 12:5</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 1:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.1.1\">1 S 1:1</a> (referindo-se a um antepassado de Elcana) <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:26\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.26\">1 K 11:26</a> (referindo-se a Jeroboão).<br><strong>2.</strong>  proveniente de <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> <strong>2;</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ מִבֵּית לֶחֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.12\">1 S 17:12</a> (referindo-se a Jessé); plural: <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶפְרָתִים מִבֵּית לֶחֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 1:2\" href=\"/Ruth.1.2\">Ru 1:2</a>.",
