      "ordinal": 766,
      "headword": "מוֹפֵת",
      "ref": "BDB, מוֹפֵת",
      "preview": "מוֹפֵת: prodígio, sinal e presságio; formas, manifestações divinas, falsos profetas, sinais e atos simbólicos.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹפֵת</span></big>  <strong>s.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 29:2\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.29.2\">Dt 29:2</a></sup> <strong>prodígio, sinal, presságio (</strong>= <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹאפֵת</span><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹפֵת</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 7:9\" href=\"/Exodus.7.9\">Ex 7:9</a> + 14 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹפֶתְכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 12:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.12.11\">Ez 12:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹפְתִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:34\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.34\">Dt 4:34</a> + 4 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹפְתִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 6:22\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.6.22\">Dt 6:22</a> + 9 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹפְתַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 7:3\" href=\"/Exodus.7.3\">Ex 7:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 11:9\" href=\"/Exodus.11.9\">11:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹפְתָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:43\" href=\"/Psalms.78.43\">ψ 78:43</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹפְתָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 16:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.16.12\">1 Ch 16:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:5\" href=\"/Psalms.105.5\">ψ 105:5</a>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>prodígio</em>, como manifestação especial do poder de Deus <a data-ref=\"Exodus 7:3\" href=\"/Exodus.7.3\">Ex 7:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 11:9\" href=\"/Exodus.11.9\">11:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:5\" href=\"/Psalms.105.5\">ψ 105:5</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 16:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.16.12\">1 Ch 16:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Joel 3:3\" href=\"/Joel.3.3\">Jo 3:3</a>; por meio de Moisés e Arão <a data-ref=\"Exodus 4:21\" href=\"/Exodus.4.21\">Ex 4:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 11:10\" href=\"/Exodus.11.10\">11:10</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 7:9\" href=\"/Exodus.7.9\">7:9</a> (na fala de Faraó); por falsos profetas <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 13:2\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.13.2\">Dt 13:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 13:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.13.3\">3</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אות</span>); geralmente em paralelo com <span dir=\"rtl\">אות</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:34\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.34\">Dt 4:34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 6:22\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.6.22\">6:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.19\">7:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 26:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.26.8\">26:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 29:2\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.29.2\">29:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 34:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.34.11\">34:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:43\" href=\"/Psalms.78.43\">ψ 78:43</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:27\" href=\"/Psalms.105.27\">105:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 135:9\" href=\"/Psalms.135.9\">135:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 32:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.32.20\">Je 32:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 32:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.32.21\">21</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:10\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.10\">Ne 9:10</a>; aplicado ao efeito da maldição de YHWH <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:46\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.46\">Dt 28:46</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אות</span>); a uma pessoa protegida por <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 71:7\" href=\"/Psalms.71.7\">ψ 71:7</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>sinal</em> ou <em>indício</em> de acontecimento futuro (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אוֹת\" href=\"/BDB,_אוֹת\", dir=\"rtl\">אוֹת</a>) <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:3\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.3\">1 K 13:3</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:5\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.5\">5</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 32:24\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.32.24\">2 Ch 32:24</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 32:31\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.32.31\">31</a>; ato simbólico <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 20:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.20.3\">Is 20:3</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אות</span>); como tal, o termo aplica-se a pessoas <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.18\">Is 8:18</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אות</span>) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 12:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.12.6\">Ez 12:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 12:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.12.11\">11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:24\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.24\">24:24</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:27\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.27\">27</a>; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אַנְשֵׁי מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 3:8\" href=\"/Zechariah.3.8\">Zc 3:8</a> <em>homens que servem como símbolo ou sinal</em>. — O verbo empregado, tratando-se de um ato divino, é <span dir=\"rtl\">נתן</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 7:9\" href=\"/Exodus.7.9\">Ex 7:9</a> etc.; <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂים</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 32:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.32.20\">Je 32:20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂים</span> também para confiar à capacidade humana <a data-ref=\"Exodus 4:21\" href=\"/Exodus.4.21\">Ex 4:21</a>; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּבֶּר</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:3\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.3\">1 K 13:3</a>; tratando-se da ação humana, <span dir=\"rtl\">עשׂה</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 4:21\" href=\"/Exodus.4.21\">Ex 4:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 11:10\" href=\"/Exodus.11.10\">11:10</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נתן</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:3\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.3\">1 K 13:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:5\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.5\">5</a>.",
