      "preview": "אֵ֫צֶל: proximidade, preposição «ao lado de», forma com מִן e usos com sufixo.",
      "html": "I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֵ֫צֶל</span></big><sub>61</sub>  <strong>substantivo: união, proximidade</strong>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶצְלִי</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶצְלוֹ</span> etc.; usado somente como <strong>preposição</strong><br><strong>a.</strong>  (como acusativo implícito) <strong>na proximidade de</strong> (como se fosse <span dir=\"rtl\">وِصْلَ</span> Lag<sup>BN 68</sup>), <strong>ao lado de</strong>: <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:10\" href=\"/Genesis.39.10\">Gn 39:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:15\" href=\"/Genesis.39.15\">15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:3\" href=\"/Genesis.41.3\">41:3</a> e ficaram <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵצֶל הַפָּרוֹת</span> <em>ao lado de</em> as vacas, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 5:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.5.2\">1 S 5:2</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵצֶל דָּגוֹן</span> <em>ao lado de</em> Dagom, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:19\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.19\">20:19</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:24\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.24\">1 K 13:24</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:25\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.25\">25</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:1\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.1\">21:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:30\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.30\">Pr 8:30</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 1:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.1.15\">Ez 1:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 1:19\" href=\"/Ezekiel.1.19\">19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 33:30\" href=\"/Ezekiel.33.30\">33:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 39:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.39.15\">39:15</a>; frequentemente na expressão <span dir=\"rtl\">(מ׳ י׳) אֵצֶל הַמִּזְבֵּחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 1:16\" href=\"/Leviticus.1.16\">Lv 1:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 6:3\" href=\"/Leviticus.6.3\">6:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 16:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.16.21\">Dt 16:21</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 2:29\" href=\"/I_Kings.2.29\">1 K 2:29</a> <a data-ref=\"Amos 2:8\" href=\"/Amos.2.8\">Am 2:8</a> +; de uma localidade (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֵת²\" href=\"/BDB,_אֵת²\", dir=\"rtl\">II. אֵת</a> <strong>2</strong>) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 11:30\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.11.30\">Dt 11:30</a> <em>ao lado de</em> os terebintos de Moré, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:9\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.9\">1 K 1:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 4:12\" href=\"/I_Kings.4.12\">4:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 41:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.41.17\">Je 41:17</a>. Após um verbo de movimento (uso tardio) <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:7\" href=\"/Daniel.8.7\">Dn 8:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:17\" href=\"/Daniel.8.17\">17</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.15\">2 Ch 28:15b</a>.<br><strong>b.</strong> com <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵאֵצֶל</span> <em>de junto de, de ao lado de</em> (cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵאֵת</span>, <a data-ref=\"BDB, מֵעִם\" href=\"/BDB,_מֵעִם\", dir=\"rtl\">מֵעִם</a>): †<a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:41\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.41\">1 S 20:41</a> (leia-se com 𝔊 <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵאֵצֶל הָאַרְגָּב</span> <em>de junto de</em> o montículo); <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.7\">Ez 40:7</a> <em>contíguo a, ao lado de</em> (<span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> <strong>1 c</strong>); com sufixo <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:30\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.30\">1 S 17:30</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּסֹּב מֵאֶצְלוֹ</span> e ele se voltou <em>de junto dele</em>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 3:20\" href=\"/I_Kings.3.20\">1 K 3:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 20:36\" href=\"/I_Kings.20.36\">20:36</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 10:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.10.16\">Ez 10:16</a>.",
