      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֵ֫צֶר</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio masculino (</strong><em>tesouro;</em> ou <em>aliança</em>; árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">إِصْرٌ</span> <strong>)</strong> chefe dos horeus <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:21\" href=\"/Genesis.36.21\">Gn 36:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:27\" href=\"/Genesis.36.27\">27</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:30\" href=\"/Genesis.36.30\">30</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:38\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.38\">1 Ch 1:38</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:42\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.42\">42</a>.",
